; AlgoX SuperTrend Pro EA - preset M15_C_NY_Expansion
; M15: New York session expansion
; family: session | hard filters: InpStructMode, InpVolFilterMode, InpRange200Mode, InpUseSessionFilter, InpMaxSpreadPoints>0
; status: watch
; A15_A restricted to the New York session (16:01-21:59 UTC with a 3h broker offset) and a stricter ATR gate (3.5 USD): the spread is a fixed cost, so it is paid only in the window where the range actually expands. Structure break, 200-bar extreme and relative volume are hard, the H1 trend and the MACD add score.
; Generated by generate_presets.py - do not edit by hand.
; Copy to MQL4/Presets and load it from the Inputs tab (Load button).
; Coherence rules: max 2 hard filters per family, max 5 in total,
; everything else inside a family stays on score so the filters do not fight each other.

